      "page": 467,
      "ruku": 404,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4138,
      "text": "Before them, the people of Noah rejected and so did [other] parties after them. Every nation plotted against its messenger to seize him and falsely argued to refute the truth with falsehood, so I seized them. How [horrible] was My punishment!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
